### Gamesuite server – IntelliJ HTTP Client requests
### Requires the IntelliJ IDEA Built-In REST Client. Click the run icon next to a request.

### Variables
@host = https://gamesuite-server.onrender.com
# Use this instead for the local server (`./gradlew :server:run`):
# @host = http://localhost:8080
@username = restclient
@gameName = minesweeper
@stage = easy
@level = 1

### Root
GET {{host}}/

### Health
GET {{host}}/health

### Get scores for a user
GET {{host}}/{{username}}/{{gameName}}/{{stage}}/{{level}}

### Post a won level (no authentication required)
POST {{host}}/{{username}}/{{gameName}}/{{stage}}/{{level}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "time": 1500,
  "points": 120,
  "won": true
}

### Post a lost attempt (counted in the summary, never in the highscore)
POST {{host}}/{{username}}/{{gameName}}/{{stage}}/{{level}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "time": 60,
  "points": -40,
  "won": false
}

### Level highscore (top 10 + total plays)
GET {{host}}/highscores/{{gameName}}/{{stage}}/{{level}}

### User summary (levels won/played, best and total points per game+stage)
GET {{host}}/summary/{{username}}

### HexMine stage (same stage names as Minesweeper)
GET {{host}}/highscores/hexmine/expert/1

### Hexlaser stages: absolute_beginner, easy, intermediate, intermediate_plus, intermediate_plus2, hard, harder, insane, nightmare, nightmare_plus, nightmare_plus2
GET {{host}}/highscores/hexlaser/easy/1

### Rejected: unknown game -> 400
GET {{host}}/highscores/notagame/easy/1

### Rejected: unknown stage -> 400
GET {{host}}/highscores/minesweeper/impossible/1

### Rejected: dropped custom stage -> 400
GET {{host}}/highscores/minesweeper/custom-12x12-24/1

### Rejected: invalid level -> 400
GET {{host}}/highscores/minesweeper/easy/0
